            "pins": [],
            "text": "Verilog LED chaser\nClock-step once with RESET=1, then click RESET to 0.\nRun or clock-step to move the lit bit. ENABLE=0 pauses it.\nREVERSE changes direction. SPEED=0 moves every clock; 3 every four clocks.\nDouble-click SPEED during simulation to enter a hex digit (0–F).\nStop, select led_chaser in Modules, then Edit to change the source.\nBrowse HDL signals to probe chaser.divider and watch the speed counter.",
